#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
#~ "forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
#~ "plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Gaya setir pada game balap: gaya pemusatan dan menikung\n"
#~ "yang didekode dari perintah drive board milik game,\n"
#~ "ditambah hentakan saat Anda menabrak sesuatu."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "A gain on every force of the drive board. At 100 %, the\n"
#~ "board's full power (63) gives the wheel's full force, every\n"
#~ "force in proportion. 200 % doubles every force: those above\n"
#~ "half the board's power (32, Sega Rally's strongest torque)\n"
#~ "then saturate."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Penguatan pada setiap gaya papan penggerak. Pada 100 %, daya\n"
#~ "penuh papan (63) memberi gaya penuh setir, setiap gaya\n"
#~ "sebanding. 200 % menggandakan setiap gaya: gaya di atas\n"
#~ "setengah daya papan (32, torsi terkuat Sega Rally) lalu jenuh."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The centring spring of the Sega Rally Championship and\n"
#~ "Daytona USA cabinets: very light, it brings the wheel\n"
#~ "back and is barely felt when held against. A share of\n"
#~ "the resistance above. The other games' cabinets drive\n"
#~ "the wheel with no spring, and ignore this setting."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Pegas pemusat pada mesin Sega Rally Championship dan\n"
#~ "Daytona USA: sangat ringan, mengembalikan setir dan hampir\n"
#~ "tidak terasa saat ditahan. Sebagian dari resistansi di atas.\n"
#~ "Mesin game lain menggerakkan setir tanpa pegas dan\n"
#~ "mengabaikan pengaturan ini."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The motor strength set on the drive board's DIP switches,\n"
#~ "the switches ON counted in binary: 0 = all OFF.\n"
#~ "Sega Rally: switches 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every torque.\n"
#~ "Daytona USA: switches 1-3, 4 times that.\n"
#~ "Indy 500, Touring Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h:\n"
#~ "switches 1-1 to 1-3, 0 to 7 added to every force."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Kekuatan motor yang diatur sakelar DIP papan penggerak,\n"
#~ "sakelar ON dihitung biner: 0 = semua OFF.\n"
#~ "Sega Rally: sakelar 1-3, 0 sampai 7 ditambahkan ke setiap\n"
#~ "torsi. Daytona USA: sakelar 1-3, 4 kali itu. Indy 500, Touring\n"
#~ "Car, Over Rev, Super GT 24h: sakelar 1-1 sampai 1-3, 0 sampai\n"
#~ "7 ditambahkan ke setiap gaya."

#, no-c-format
